e30f4.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/0134/live/27e44540-66d3-11f1-8546-8f19e4fe30f4.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/0134/live/27e44540-66d3-11f1-8546-8f19e4fe30f4.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/0134/live/27e44540-66d3-11f1-8546-8f19e4fe30f4.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/0134/live/27e44540-66d3-11f1-8546-8f19e4fe30f4.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/0134/live/27e44540-66d3-11f1-8546-8f19e4fe30f4.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Two World Cup mascots breaking into an iron gate with a metal pole.\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Watch: Peru police dress up as World Cup mascots during drug raid</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">Peruvian police officers disguised themselves as 2026 World Cup mascots to break into the home of a suspected drug dealer - and football fan.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">Latin America</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/cqlplddez4xo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260616-142550-2eb0b085ec-web-3.10.0-4/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/8180/live/fd61b2b0-604e-11f1-89a3-d1f559421220.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/8180/live/fd61b2b0-604e-11f1-89a3-d1f559421220.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/8180/live/fd61b2b0-604e-11f1-89a3-d1f559421220.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/8180/live/fd61b2b0-604e-11f1-