92a/live/6eae6d00-5375-11f1-b319-63ed6ac90e5f.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/a92a/live/6eae6d00-5375-11f1-b319-63ed6ac90e5f.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/a92a/live/6eae6d00-5375-11f1-b319-63ed6ac90e5f.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A handful of protestors run across the road with smoke rising in the background\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Anti-government demonstrators and police clash in Bolivia</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">Protesters have been calling for the president to resign after weeks-long unrest.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">Latin America</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/c8r8j50zxnno\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260616-142550-2eb0b085ec-web-3.10.0-4/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/e745/live/d97351a0-46be-11f1-8e27-e5ac1aa07cb6.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/e745/live/d97351a0-46be-11f1-8e27-e5ac1aa07cb6.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/e745/live/d97351a0-46be-11f1-8e27-e5ac1aa07cb6.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/e745/live/d97351a0-46be-11f1-8e27-e5ac1aa07cb6.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/e745/live/d97351a0-46be-11f1-8e27-e5ac1aa07cb6.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/e745/live/d97351a0-46be-11f1-8e27-e5ac1aa07cb6.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/e745/live/d97351a0-46be-11f1-8e27-e5ac1aa07cb6.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/e745/live/d97351a0-46be-11f1-8e27-e5ac1aa07cb6.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Shakira in a green top, her long brown hair loose, smiling on stage\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Huge crowd attends free Shakira Copacabana beach concert</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">Shakira's appearance followed shows by Lady Gaga and Madonna, who have also performed on Copacabana beach in previous years.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">Latin America</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/c2k2d3jk2x8o\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260616-142550-2eb0b085ec-web-3.10.0-4/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/0bc4/live/db6aba90-44aa-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/0bc4/live/db6aba90-44aa-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/0bc4/live/db6aba90-44aa-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/0bc4/live/db6aba90-44aa-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/0bc4/live/db6aba90-44aa-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/0bc4/live/db6aba90-44aa-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/0bc4/live/db6aba90-44aa-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/0bc4/live/db6aba90-44aa-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.j