6-142550-2eb0b085ec-web-3.10.0-4/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/dd19/live/1a02f190-f263-11f0-b5f7-49f0357294ff.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/dd19/live/1a02f190-f263-11f0-b5f7-49f0357294ff.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/dd19/live/1a02f190-f263-11f0-b5f7-49f0357294ff.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/dd19/live/1a02f190-f263-11f0-b5f7-49f0357294ff.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/dd19/live/1a02f190-f263-11f0-b5f7-49f0357294ff.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/dd19/live/1a02f190-f263-11f0-b5f7-49f0357294ff.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/dd19/live/1a02f190-f263-11f0-b5f7-49f0357294ff.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/dd19/live/1a02f190-f263-11f0-b5f7-49f0357294ff.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"BBC correspondent Will Grant on Cuban street with army personal in the backgroud.\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Public pay their respects to Cubans killed in Venezuela during US raid</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">The BBC's Will Grant is in Cuba's capital, Havana, where people lined the streets to pay tribute.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">Latin America</span></p></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div>",
